{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Silkgrove</strong>\u00a0is an open-world game set in a post-apocalyptic environment following a war between humans and machines. In the game, you take on the role of Annie, a young Restorer equipped with a set of tools and a mission to help rebuild the  world using sustainable practices.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fix things, craft new items, and explore to uncover stories from each place you visit. You can decorate your  home camp, meet interesting characters, and learn about the past world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You can play at your own pace, traveling through various environments, collecting resources, facing challenges, or simply camping and enjoying serene landscapes.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Features</strong>\u00a0</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Explore an Open World</strong>: Journey through a  post-apocalyptic landscape filled with unique items, resources, and past world secrets.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Collecting and Scavenging</strong>: Gather materials and salvage items from the environment for your needs.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Craft and Build</strong>: Use materials to create tools, scrape for materials, and upgrade your home camp.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Fixing and Maintenance</strong>: Repair broken items and maintain tools to keep everything running smoothly</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Farming</strong>: Grow  food, use hydroponics, monitor food forests, and manage resources sustainably to support your journey.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Resource Management</strong>: Collect and manage different resources to aid your progress.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Camp Home</strong>: Camp, customize, and upgrade your mobile camp home.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Discover 